# Repository-level ignores.
#
# Commit 3901728 deleted the agent skill libraries from numo-site/ but added no
# ignore rule and there was no root .gitignore at all, so the next agent run put
# them straight back — this time inside two stale worktrees under .claude/, where
# they were less visible. That was 495 files and 31MB of another machine's tooling
# tracked as if it were this project's source. These rules are the part that was
# missing, so it does not happen a third time.

# Agent worktrees. Scratch checkouts an agent creates while working; each holds a
# full copy of the repo. Never this project's source.
.claude/worktrees/

# Agent skill libraries, for whichever tool a contributor happens to use. These
# are installed per machine, not shared through the repo.
**/.agent/skills/
**/.agents/skills/
**/.claude/skills/
**/.cline/skills/
**/.codebuddy/skills/
**/.codex/skills/
**/.commandcode/skills/
**/.continue/skills/
**/.crush/skills/
**/.cursor/skills/
**/.factory/skills/
**/.gemini/skills/
**/.github/skills/
**/.goose/skills/
**/.junie/skills/
**/.kilocode/skills/
**/.kiro/skills/
**/.kode/skills/
**/.mcpjam/skills/
**/.mux/skills/
**/.neovate/skills/
**/.opencode/skills/
**/.openhands/skills/
**/.pi/skills/
**/.pochi/skills/
**/.qoder/skills/
**/.qwen/skills/
**/.roo/skills/
**/.trae/skills/
**/.windsurf/skills/
**/.zencoder/skills/

# Symlink shims that pointed into .agents/skills. 3901728 deleted the target and
# left these dangling; they are tracked as symlinks so they survive a normal clean.
numo-site/skills/

# Local agent session state
**/.impeccable/hook.cache.json
**/.impeccable/hook.pending.json
**/.impeccable/config.local.json
**/.impeccable/live/

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
